# ============================================================
# DBZ TWIN SUBSTANCE RESTORATION
# ============================================================
# Learned from DBZ Twin WRITING.md: each chapter earns a word
# count because the paragraph carries unique meaning. We cut the
# mug padding. Now we restore words with substance:
# - Holds (the camera holds, unbroken, on a character as they
#   process, reference, remember, and answer)
# - Reactions (every action gets a reaction from someone who
#   did not cause it)
# - Inserts (close-up on a detail that changes the story:
#   a hand going into a pocket, a costume element, a stamp)
# - World cuts (cut to the city in the background and back)
# - Eye-catch devices
# - Repeat-it-back for clarity
# - Shot budgets (uneven shot lengths)
# ============================================================

def get_chapter_num(filename):
    m = re.search(r'Chapter_(\d+)_', filename)
    return int(m.group(1)) if m else 0

